      94.17,
      335.05,
      491.62,
      358.12
    ],
    "text": "A PROCLAMATION BY HIS EXCELLENCYTHE PRESIDENT OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      450.81,
      384.01,
      537.69,
      395.08
    ],
    "text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      432.49,
      537.94,
      465.64
    ],
    "text": "KNOW YE that by virtue of the powers vested in me by Article 70 of the Constitution of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka and in pursuance of the provisions of Section 10 of the Parliamentary Elections Act, No.1 of1981, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this Proclamation -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      74.73,
      476.41,
      537.98,
      498.52
    ],
    "text": "(a)Dissolve Parliament, with effect from midnight today and summon the new Parliament to meet on the First day ofSeptember, Two Thousand and Fifteen;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      74.01,
      509.53,
      537.71,
      531.64
    ],
    "text": "(b)Fix the Seventeenth day of August, Two Thousand and Fifteen as the date for the election of Members ofParliament ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      74.73,
      542.41,
      538.01,
      575.56
    ],
    "text": "(c)Specify the period beginning on the Sixth day of July, Two Thousand and Fifteen and ending at Twelve Noon ofthe Thirteenth day of July, Two Thousand and Fifteen as the nomination period, during which nomination papersshall be received by the Returning Officers ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      74.01,
      586.57,
      537.97,
      608.44
    ],
    "text": "(d)Specify each place mentioned in Column II of the Schedule hereto as the place of nomination for candidatesseeking election in the electoral district mentioned in the corresponding entry in Column I of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      620.17,
      451.39,
      631.24
    ],
    "text": "Given at Colombo on this Twenty Sixth day of June, in the year Two Thousand and Fifteen.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      644.17,
      535.06,
      679.24
    ],
    "text": "By Order of His Excellency,P. B. ABEYKOON,Secretary to the President.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      101.13,
      385.69,
      119.85,
      396.76
    ],
    "text": "Seal",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
